//! Real mainnet Merkle-Patricia proofs, from `eth_getProof`.
//!
//! Generated by `tools/mpt_to_fe.py` from `deneb_join_mainnet.json`. Nothing here is
//! synthetic: the nodes are the ones a mainnet node served for block
//! 19,426,587, and the values are what it reported for the same
//! keys, so the tests that use them are differential tests against geth's own
//! trie rather than against our reading of the spec.
//!
//! Provenance
//! ----------
//!   endpoint      an archive node (eth_getProof needs one; verifying does not)
//!   method        eth_getProof + eth_call
//!   block         19,426,587
//!   block hash    0xf8e2f40d98fe5862bc947c8c83d34799c50fb344d7445d020a8a946d891b62ee
//!   state root    0xbd33ab68095087d81beb810b3f5d0b16050b3f798ae3978e440bab048dd78992
//!
//! The state root here is the block header's own. Joining it to a
//! *beacon-proven* state root needs a fixture whose EIP-4788 anchor is still
//! inside the 27.3 h window -- see `docs/forward-compat.md`.

